          "title": "You'll want to know: la lancha",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la lancha — \"the launch, the motorboat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Fuimos a la cueva en lancha. We went to the cave by motorboat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La lancha has a motor; la barca is often rowed."
            }
          ]
        },
